{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"I will sing of|strong=\"H4905\"the loving kindness of|strong=\"H4905\"the LORD|strong=\"H3068\"forever.  \nWith my mouth, I will make known your faithfulness to all generations.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"I|strong=\"H3045\"indeed|strong=\"H3068\"declare|strong=\"H3045\", “Love|strong=\"H2617\"stands firm forever|strong=\"H5769\".  \nYou|strong=\"H3045\"established the|strong=\"H3068\"heavens.  \nYour|strong=\"H3068\"faithfulness|strong=\"H2617\"is|strong=\"H3068\"in|strong=\"H3068\"them|strong=\"H3068\".”   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"“I|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H1129\"made|strong=\"H3559\"a|strong=\"H3068\"covenant with|strong=\"H8064\"my|strong=\"H3588\"chosen one|strong=\"H3588\",  \nI|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H1129\"sworn to|strong=\"H3559\"David, my|strong=\"H3588\"servant,   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"‘I|strong=\"H5650\"will|strong=\"H5650\"establish your|strong=\"H3772\"offspring forever,  \nand|strong=\"H5650\"build up your|strong=\"H3772\"throne to|strong=\"H1732\"all|strong=\"H3772\"generations.’” Selah."},{"number":5,"text":"The|strong=\"H1129\"heavens will|strong=\"H2233\"praise|strong=\"H5769\"your|strong=\"H3559\"wonders, LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nyour|strong=\"H3559\"faithfulness|strong=\"H3559\"also in|strong=\"H1129\"the|strong=\"H1129\"assembly of|strong=\"H2233\"the|strong=\"H1129\"holy ones.   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"For|strong=\"H3068\"who|strong=\"H3068\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"skies can be|strong=\"H3068\"compared to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"?  \nWho|strong=\"H3068\"among the|strong=\"H3068\"sons of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"heavenly|strong=\"H8064\"beings is|strong=\"H3068\"like|strong=\"H8064\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"a|strong=\"H3068\"very awesome God|strong=\"H3068\"in|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3588\"council of|strong=\"H1121\"the|strong=\"H3588\"holy ones|strong=\"H1121\",  \nto|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H3068\"feared above all|strong=\"H3068\"those|strong=\"H1121\"who|strong=\"H4310\"are|strong=\"H1121\"around him|strong=\"H3588\"?   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", God of|strong=\"H6918\"Armies, who|strong=\"H3605\"is|strong=\"H3605\"a|strong=\"H3068\"mighty|strong=\"H7227\"one|strong=\"H6918\", like|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H3605\"?  \nLORD|strong=\"H3068\", your|strong=\"H3605\"faithfulness is|strong=\"H3605\"around|strong=\"H5439\"you|strong=\"H3605\".   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"You|strong=\"H3644\"rule the|strong=\"H3068\"pride of|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"sea.  \nWhen|strong=\"H3068\"its|strong=\"H5439\"waves rise up, you|strong=\"H3644\"calm them|strong=\"H5439\".   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"You have|strong=\"H4910\"broken Rahab in|strong=\"H4910\"pieces, like one of|strong=\"H3220\"the|strong=\"H7623\"slain.  \nYou have|strong=\"H4910\"scattered your|strong=\"H7623\"enemies with|strong=\"H3220\"your|strong=\"H7623\"mighty arm.   \n"},{"number":11,"text":"The|strong=\"H6340\"heavens are|strong=\"H2491\"yours.  \nThe|strong=\"H6340\"earth also|strong=\"H5797\"is|strong=\"H2220\"yours,  \nthe|strong=\"H6340\"world and|strong=\"H5797\"its fullness.  \nYou have|strong=\"H2220\"founded them.   \n"},{"number":12,"text":"You have created the|strong=\"H3245\"north and|strong=\"H8064\"the|strong=\"H3245\"south.  \nTabor and|strong=\"H8064\"Hermon rejoice in|strong=\"H8064\"your|strong=\"H8064\"name.   \n"},{"number":13,"text":"You have|strong=\"H8034\"a|strong=\"H3068\"mighty arm.  \nYour hand|strong=\"H3225\"is|strong=\"H8034\"strong, and|strong=\"H6828\"your right|strong=\"H3225\"hand|strong=\"H3225\"is|strong=\"H8034\"exalted.   \n"},{"number":14,"text":"Righteousness and|strong=\"H3027\"justice are|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H3027\"foundation of|strong=\"H3027\"your|strong=\"H3027\"throne.  \nLoving kindness and|strong=\"H3027\"truth go before|strong=\"H5973\"your|strong=\"H3027\"face.   \n"},{"number":15,"text":"Blessed are|strong=\"H4941\"the|strong=\"H6440\"people who|strong=\"H6664\"learn to|strong=\"H6440\"acclaim you|strong=\"H6440\".  \nThey|strong=\"H6440\"walk in|strong=\"H6440\"the|strong=\"H6440\"light of|strong=\"H6440\"your|strong=\"H6440\"presence|strong=\"H6440\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\".   \n"},{"number":16,"text":"In|strong=\"H1980\"your|strong=\"H3068\"name they|strong=\"H3068\"rejoice all|strong=\"H3045\"day.  \nIn|strong=\"H1980\"your|strong=\"H3068\"righteousness, they|strong=\"H3068\"are|strong=\"H5971\"exalted.   \n"},{"number":17,"text":"For|strong=\"H8034\"you|strong=\"H3605\"are|strong=\"H3117\"the|strong=\"H3605\"glory of|strong=\"H3117\"their|strong=\"H3605\"strength.  \nIn|strong=\"H3117\"your|strong=\"H3605\"favor, our|strong=\"H3605\"horn will|strong=\"H3117\"be|strong=\"H8034\"exalted|strong=\"H7311\".   \n"},{"number":18,"text":"For|strong=\"H3588\"our|strong=\"H3588\"shield belongs to|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nour|strong=\"H3588\"king to|strong=\"H3588\"the|strong=\"H3588\"Holy One|strong=\"H3588\"of|strong=\"H7161\"Israel.   \n"},{"number":19,"text":"Then|strong=\"H4428\"you|strong=\"H3588\"spoke in|strong=\"H3478\"vision to|strong=\"H3478\"your|strong=\"H3068\"saints|strong=\"H6918\",  \nand|strong=\"H3478\"said, “I|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H3068\"given strength to|strong=\"H3478\"the|strong=\"H3588\"warrior.  \nI|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H3068\"exalted a|strong=\"H3068\"young man from|strong=\"H3478\"the|strong=\"H3588\"people.   \n"},{"number":20,"text":"I|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H5971\"found David, my|strong=\"H5921\"servant.  \nI|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H5971\"anointed him|strong=\"H5921\"with|strong=\"H1696\"my|strong=\"H5921\"holy|strong=\"H2623\"oil,   \n"},{"number":21,"text":"with|strong=\"H4886\"whom my|strong=\"H1732\"hand|strong=\"H4672\"shall|strong=\"H5650\"be|strong=\"H5650\"established.  \nMy|strong=\"H1732\"arm will|strong=\"H5650\"also|strong=\"H1732\"strengthen him|strong=\"H4672\".   \n"},{"number":22,"text":"No enemy will|strong=\"H3027\"tax him|strong=\"H3027\".  \nNo wicked man will|strong=\"H3027\"oppress him|strong=\"H3027\".   \n"},{"number":23,"text":"I|strong=\"H3808\"will|strong=\"H1121\"beat down his|strong=\"H3808\"adversaries before|strong=\"H3808\"him|strong=\"H1121\",  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"strike those|strong=\"H1121\"who|strong=\"H1121\"hate him|strong=\"H1121\".   \n"},{"number":24,"text":"But|strong=\"H5062\"my|strong=\"H6440\"faithfulness and|strong=\"H6440\"my|strong=\"H6440\"loving kindness will|strong=\"H6440\"be|strong=\"H6440\"with|strong=\"H6440\"him|strong=\"H6440\".  \nIn|strong=\"H6440\"my|strong=\"H6440\"name, his|strong=\"H6440\"horn will|strong=\"H6440\"be|strong=\"H6440\"exalted.   \n"},{"number":25,"text":"I|strong=\"H7311\"will|strong=\"H8034\"set|strong=\"H7311\"his|strong=\"H7311\"hand also|strong=\"H8034\"on|strong=\"H5973\"the|strong=\"H5973\"sea,  \nand|strong=\"H2617\"his|strong=\"H7311\"right hand on|strong=\"H5973\"the|strong=\"H5973\"rivers.   \n"},{"number":26,"text":"He|strong=\"H3027\"will|strong=\"H3027\"call to|strong=\"H3027\"me|strong=\"H7760\", ‘You|strong=\"H7760\"are|strong=\"H3027\"my|strong=\"H7760\"Father,  \nmy|strong=\"H7760\"God|strong=\"H3027\", and|strong=\"H3027\"the|strong=\"H7760\"rock of|strong=\"H3027\"my|strong=\"H7760\"salvation!’   \n"},{"number":27,"text":"I|strong=\"H6697\"will|strong=\"H1931\"also|strong=\"H1931\"appoint him|strong=\"H7121\"my|strong=\"H7121\"firstborn,  \nthe|strong=\"H7121\"highest of|strong=\"H6697\"the|strong=\"H7121\"kings of|strong=\"H6697\"the|strong=\"H7121\"earth.   \n"},{"number":28,"text":"I|strong=\"H5414\"will|strong=\"H4428\"keep my|strong=\"H5414\"loving kindness for|strong=\"H4428\"him|strong=\"H5414\"forever more.  \nMy|strong=\"H5414\"covenant will|strong=\"H4428\"stand firm with|strong=\"H4428\"him|strong=\"H5414\".   \n"},{"number":29,"text":"I will|strong=\"H2617\"also|strong=\"H2617\"make his|strong=\"H8104\"offspring endure|strong=\"H5769\"forever|strong=\"H5769\",  \nand|strong=\"H5769\"his|strong=\"H8104\"throne as|strong=\"H2617\"the|strong=\"H8104\"days|strong=\"H5769\"of|strong=\"H1285\"heaven.   \n"},{"number":30,"text":"If|strong=\"H7760\"his|strong=\"H7760\"children|strong=\"H2233\"forsake my|strong=\"H7760\"law,  \nand|strong=\"H3117\"don’t walk in|strong=\"H3117\"my|strong=\"H7760\"ordinances;   \n"},{"number":31,"text":"if|strong=\"H1121\"they|strong=\"H3808\"break my|strong=\"H5800\"statutes,  \nand|strong=\"H1121\"don’t keep my|strong=\"H5800\"commandments;   \n"},{"number":32,"text":"then|strong=\"H3808\"I|strong=\"H3808\"will|strong=\"H3808\"punish their|strong=\"H3808\"sin with|strong=\"H2708\"the|strong=\"H8104\"rod,  \nand|strong=\"H8104\"their|strong=\"H3808\"iniquity with|strong=\"H2708\"stripes.   \n"},{"number":33,"text":"But I|strong=\"H6588\"will|strong=\"H5771\"not completely take|strong=\"H6485\"my|strong=\"H6485\"loving kindness from|strong=\"H7626\"him|strong=\"H6485\",  \nnor allow my|strong=\"H6485\"faithfulness to|strong=\"H5771\"fail.   \n"},{"number":34,"text":"I|strong=\"H3808\"will|strong=\"H3808\"not|strong=\"H3808\"break my|strong=\"H3808\"covenant,  \nnor|strong=\"H3808\"alter what my|strong=\"H3808\"lips have|strong=\"H3808\"uttered.   \n"},{"number":35,"text":"Once I|strong=\"H3808\"have|strong=\"H8193\"sworn by|strong=\"H3808\"my|strong=\"H2490\"holiness,  \nI|strong=\"H3808\"will|strong=\"H3808\"not|strong=\"H3808\"lie to|strong=\"H2490\"David.   \n"},{"number":36,"text":"His|strong=\"H1732\"offspring will endure forever,  \nhis|strong=\"H1732\"throne like the|strong=\"H1732\"sun before me.   \n"},{"number":37,"text":"It|strong=\"H1961\"will|strong=\"H1961\"be|strong=\"H1961\"established forever|strong=\"H5769\"like|strong=\"H1961\"the|strong=\"H1961\"moon,  \nthe|strong=\"H1961\"faithful witness in|strong=\"H2233\"the|strong=\"H1961\"sky.” Selah."},{"number":38,"text":"But you|strong=\"H5769\"have|strong=\"H5707\"rejected and|strong=\"H5769\"spurned.  \nYou|strong=\"H5769\"have|strong=\"H5707\"been|strong=\"H5769\"angry with your|strong=\"H3559\"anointed.   \n"},{"number":39,"text":"You|strong=\"H5973\"have|strong=\"H5973\"renounced the|strong=\"H5674\"covenant of|strong=\"H5674\"your|strong=\"H5674\"servant.  \nYou|strong=\"H5973\"have|strong=\"H5973\"defiled his|strong=\"H5674\"crown in|strong=\"H5973\"the|strong=\"H5674\"dust.   \n"},{"number":40,"text":"You have|strong=\"H5650\"broken|strong=\"H2490\"down all his|strong=\"H2490\"hedges.  \nYou have|strong=\"H5650\"brought|strong=\"H5650\"his|strong=\"H2490\"strongholds to|strong=\"H2490\"ruin.   \n"},{"number":41,"text":"All|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"pass by|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"way|strong=\"H3605\"rob him|strong=\"H7760\".  \nHe|strong=\"H3605\"has|strong=\"H3605\"become a|strong=\"H3068\"reproach to|strong=\"H3605\"his|strong=\"H3605\"neighbors.   \n"},{"number":42,"text":"You|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H1961\"exalted the|strong=\"H3605\"right hand of|strong=\"H1870\"his|strong=\"H3605\"adversaries.  \nYou|strong=\"H3605\"have|strong=\"H1961\"made|strong=\"H1961\"all|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H1870\"his|strong=\"H3605\"enemies rejoice.   \n"},{"number":43,"text":"Yes, you|strong=\"H3605\"turn|strong=\"H7311\"back the|strong=\"H3605\"edge of|strong=\"H3605\"his|strong=\"H3605\"sword,  \nand|strong=\"H8055\"haven’t supported him|strong=\"H3605\"in|strong=\"H8055\"battle.   \n"},{"number":44,"text":"You|strong=\"H7725\"have|strong=\"H3808\"ended his|strong=\"H7725\"splendor,  \nand|strong=\"H6965\"thrown his|strong=\"H7725\"throne down to|strong=\"H7725\"the|strong=\"H7725\"ground.   \n"},{"number":45,"text":"You|strong=\"H7673\"have|strong=\"H7673\"shortened the|strong=\"H7673\"days of|strong=\"H3678\"his|strong=\"H4048\"youth.  \nYou|strong=\"H7673\"have|strong=\"H7673\"covered him with shame. Selah."},{"number":46,"text":"How long|strong=\"H3117\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\"?  \nWill|strong=\"H3117\"you|strong=\"H5921\"hide yourself|strong=\"H5921\"forever|strong=\"H3117\"?  \nWill|strong=\"H3117\"your|strong=\"H5921\"wrath burn like|strong=\"H5921\"fire?   \n"},{"number":47,"text":"Remember how|strong=\"H4100\"short my|strong=\"H3068\"time|strong=\"H5704\"is|strong=\"H3068\",  \nfor|strong=\"H5704\"what|strong=\"H4100\"vanity you|strong=\"H5704\"have|strong=\"H3068\"created all|strong=\"H5704\"the|strong=\"H3068\"children of|strong=\"H3068\"men!   \n"},{"number":48,"text":"What|strong=\"H4100\"man|strong=\"H1121\"is|strong=\"H4100\"he|strong=\"H3605\"who|strong=\"H3605\"shall|strong=\"H1121\"live and|strong=\"H1121\"not|strong=\"H1121\"see death,  \nwho|strong=\"H3605\"shall|strong=\"H1121\"deliver his|strong=\"H3605\"soul from|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H3605\"power of|strong=\"H1121\"Sheol? Selah."},{"number":49,"text":"Lord, where|strong=\"H3027\"are|strong=\"H3027\"your|strong=\"H7200\"former loving kindnesses,  \nwhich|strong=\"H4310\"you|strong=\"H3808\"swore to|strong=\"H3027\"David|strong=\"H3027\"in|strong=\"H5315\"your|strong=\"H7200\"faithfulness?   \n"},{"number":50,"text":"Remember, Lord|strong=\"H2617\", the|strong=\"H1732\"reproach|strong=\"H2617\"of|strong=\"H2617\"your|strong=\"H1732\"servants,  \nhow I|strong=\"H7650\"bear in|strong=\"H1732\"my|strong=\"H1732\"heart the|strong=\"H1732\"taunts of|strong=\"H2617\"all the|strong=\"H1732\"mighty peoples,   \n"},{"number":51,"text":"With|strong=\"H5971\"which|strong=\"H5971\"your|strong=\"H3605\"enemies have|strong=\"H5971\"mocked, LORD|strong=\"H3068\",  \nwith|strong=\"H5971\"which|strong=\"H5971\"they|strong=\"H5971\"have|strong=\"H5971\"mocked the|strong=\"H3605\"footsteps of|strong=\"H5650\"your|strong=\"H3605\"anointed one|strong=\"H3605\".   \n"},{"number":52,"text":"Blessed be|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"forever more.  \nAmen, and|strong=\"H3068\"Amen.   \n"}]}
